    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Grid BFS / DFS</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Boundary flood fill</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/surrounded-regions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 130</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Surrounded Regions</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Do not search for surrounded regions; search for the ones that escape. Flood from every border <code>O</code>, tag what it reaches as safe, then one pass flips every untagged <code>O</code> to <code>X</code>. O(m·n) time, every cell touched O(1) times.</p>\n"
